# Auto push after adjustments

When the user asks for an adjustment/fix/feature and implementation is done:

1. Commit the relevant changes (clear message, no secrets: never `.env` or `*.db` / `*.bak*`).
2. Push to `origin main` (this repo: https://github.com/ChristianDS1/TBOTV2.git).
3. If push needs approval UI, request it immediately — do not leave commits unpushed.
4. Confirm with the commit hash / that `main` is up to date.

Do **not** wait for a separate "please push" message after adjustments unless the user said not to push.
